{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19006","headline":"令狐相公俯赠篇章斐然仰谢 · 刘禹锡","name":"令狐相公俯赠篇章斐然仰谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鄂渚临流别，梁园冲雪来。\n旅愁随冻释，欢意待花开。\n城晓乌频起，池春鴈欲回。\n饮和心自醉，何必管弦催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}